2026-10-06T03:53:50.1355382Z Description:
2026-10-06T03:53:50.1356782Z   forge — Mission Control Language runtime
2026-10-06T03:53:50.1357327Z 
2026-10-06T03:53:50.1357720Z Usage:
2026-10-06T03:53:50.1359057Z   forge [command] [options]
2026-10-06T03:53:50.1359610Z 
2026-10-06T03:53:50.1359796Z Options:
2026-10-06T03:53:50.1360637Z   -?, -h, --help  Show help and usage information
2026-10-06T03:53:50.1361454Z   --version       Show version information
2026-10-06T03:53:50.1361896Z 
2026-10-06T03:53:50.1362108Z Commands:
2026-10-06T03:53:50.1362950Z   init <mission>             Resolve expert sources and generate mcl.lock
2026-10-06T03:53:50.1363693Z   run <mission>              Run a mission
2026-10-06T03:53:50.1365015Z   validate <mission>         Validate a mission file and its expert references
2026-10-06T03:53:50.1365772Z   list                       List available resources
2026-10-06T03:53:50.1366330Z   expert                     Manage experts
2026-10-06T03:53:50.1367041Z   registry                   OCI registry operations
2026-10-06T03:53:50.1367800Z   login                      Sign in to Forge (browser) and store a platform key
2026-10-06T03:53:50.1368702Z   whoami                     Show the signed-in Forge user and credit balance
2026-10-06T03:53:50.1369551Z   logout                     Sign out of Forge (remove the stored platform key)
2026-10-06T03:53:50.1370400Z   exec <target> <prompt>     Run a hosted mission once and print the answer
2026-10-06T03:53:50.1371345Z   chat                       Chat with a hosted mission in the current Forge project
2026-10-06T03:53:50.1372121Z   project                    Manage portable Forge projects
2026-10-06T03:53:50.1373211Z   publish <reference> <dir>  Package a mission directory into a self-contained OCI artifact and push it
2026-10-06T03:53:50.1374390Z   clean                      Remove cached OCI experts from ~/.forge/experts
2026-10-06T03:53:50.1375163Z   serve <agent>              Serve a mission as an OpenAI-compatible endpoint
2026-10-06T03:53:50.1376031Z   claude <target>            Launch Claude Code talking to a forge mission
2026-10-06T03:53:50.1376901Z   connect                    Wire an editor's Claude Code extension to a forge mission
2026-10-06T03:53:50.1377709Z   agent                      Manage forge agents running in Docker
2026-10-06T03:53:50.1378506Z   webui                      Manage Open WebUI connected to a forge agent
2026-10-06T03:53:50.1379611Z   provider                   Manage LLM provider profiles
2026-10-06T03:53:50.1380619Z   mcp <mission>              Expose a mission as a stdio MCP server (for Claude Desktop and MCP-aware tools)
2026-10-06T03:53:50.1381223Z 
